# SHA256 manifest for z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2.
# Revision: 50307d4c4cde6860d4eee73e2547cd786fe8e8a4
#
# The DFLASH 2 DRAFTER for track bonsai2-27b-mlx-v1. It is the track's SECOND
# declarable speculative decoder, beside the MTP head, and it is a SEPARATE
# artifact from the target for the same reason the head is: the target pack
# declares mtp_num_hidden_layers: 0 and ships no drafter of any kind.
#
# The drafter is published and is used UNMODIFIED. Nothing here re-quantizes it,
# mirrors it or re-uploads it. It stays BF16 as published.
#
# The loader reads two of these three files. model.safetensors holds the
# drafter's 81 tensors; config.json declares architectures ["DFlash2DraftModel"],
# the five sliding_attention layers, and the dflash_config block that carries
# the block size, the mask token, the tapped target layer ids, the grouped
# dynamic convolution geometry and the candidate selector geometry. README.md is
# pinned because the tree is small and a flat inventory check reads in both
# directions.
#
# .gitattributes and assets/dflash2-figure.png are DELIBERATELY NOT pinned:
# the first is generated by Hugging Face and the second is documentation
# artwork. Neither is engine-loaded.
#
# model.safetensors carries the LFS object's own sha256 (lfs.oid).
#
#   MLXFAST_REFERENCE_MANIFEST_RECORDS: 3
#   MLXFAST_REFERENCE_MANIFEST_BYTES:   3848824532
#
# Format: <sha256> <byte_count> <relative_path>
